==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card features {{p|Burmy}} in all three of its {{form|Burmy|cloak}} forms.
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Brilliant Stars|Burmy|9}} from the {{TCG|Brilliant Stars}} expansion; both cards have the Hang Down attack.
*'''Hang Down''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Secret Wonders|Shuppet|110}} from the {{TCG|Secret Wonders}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Y}}.

